          "line": "Then tax",
          "props": [
            "x",
            "coin"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "id": "s6"
    },
    {
      "narration": "Which is before you consider the near-impossible odds of winning at all.",
      "shots": [
        {
          "block": "evidence",
          "sourceId": "wiki-lottery",
          "kicker": "Wikipedia · lottery"
        }
      ],
      "id": "s7"
    },
    {
      "narration": "So the real choice is a smaller cash pile now, or bigger payments spread over decades.",
      "shots": [
        {
          "block": "stat",
          "art": "vault",
          "big": "cash vs time",
          "label": "the real decision",
